<title>FRANCE: Europcar posts 1996 operating profit.</title>
<headline>Europcar posts 1996 operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car hire group Europcar, jointly-owned by Accor and Volkswagen AG, said it had returned to a positive operating result for 1996.</p>
<p>In an invite to a news conference for January 16, managing director John Du Monceau said his company had returned to operating profits in one year and its sales were growing 1.5 times the market average.</p>
<p>Europcar declined to give details on its results until the date of the news conference when it will also unveil an &quot;important innovation in car hire&quot;.</p>
</text>
